{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "17a3df717bcd1e42d68e178ae991a526442b4ae1b3d16de6bcafd38bf7a7a4fa", "ja": "セクシーと芝居に近道なし", "zh": "性感和演戏都没有捷径", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c4aadce0be964029306217c6f99e1f619f8c95af73e79ec6a3178c19d12a3045", "ja": "リハーサル後、莉緒と話していると、劇場の\nどこかから声がする。正体は、残って練習を\nしていた千鶴だった。演技に悩む千鶴に、\nアドバイスする莉緒。2人が終電を逃したと\n心配する千鶴を、プロデューサーが送る。", "zh": "排练完后，在跟莉绪说话时，\n剧场某处传来了声音。\n声音的来源是留下来练习的千鹤。\n看着为演技烦恼的千鹤，莉绪给了一些建议。\n制作人送担心二人赶不上末班车的千鹤回家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "ab211a3583188f232faabd1da2ef9ff38504f688fa46e0b126ea832dbfe7d6a7", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}くん♪\n今帰り？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}♪\n你正要回家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a3dfcd577ce1be771bd3db83ef88d1db3c565b2545b36d0b62637ecaf916bd6c", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま莉緒。\n莉緒もこれから帰るところか？", "zh": "嗯，你也辛苦了，莉绪。\n莉绪也正准备回家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "473d5c62d91f13e8b87525d2d405f1bc262fdcf3465a6e8d6b405a0d0080117b", "ja": "ええ。でも帰る前に、予約してたエステに行くわ。\n毎日のお手入れが、お肌を輝かせるの。", "zh": "嗯，不过回家之前我预约了护肤。\n每天保养才能让肌肤容光焕发嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "1f7373da0e1fae2ff94f1afc89f2ccdc9e55aa0758d6691e2575c1175136a790", "ja": "セクシーに近道なし！って、\nセクシーの偉大な先輩も言ってたしね♪", "zh": "性感界的伟大前辈也说了，\n性感没有捷径！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "979c08485e0273f46db4c7b6c24dd5baaba7663d7628482e3191d039d1ff0d5a", "ja": "偉大な先輩？", "zh": "伟大前辈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "b77752f82792914757d72e8350bb2e3912027db8f21f2eb99e3d39fbeb7719ad", "ja": "もちろん、このみ姉さんよ！", "zh": "当然是木实姊啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e0c192811632ce764ff97b24a846ee3c72d78f7ed619f7cc0b723cc8f4441e98", "ja": "……なるほど。\nいろいろと深い……気がするな。", "zh": "……原来如此。\n感觉各方面都很深奥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "5173ab2f0415da72497fc8fef3ca5c7b1a8256a32ea8ac27adeecd84569bfc9a", "ja": "…………、…………だ……。", "zh": "…………因…………鬼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "e22d041008ecb5dcc935650fb29d31913762cd9b095239d263771a913d8b6cfb", "ja": "あら？　……ねぇ、何か声が聞こえない？\n{$P$}くん。", "zh": "咦？\n……你有听到什么声音吗？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "98ae89d9c6d3ff2cd794e1886cf9664d77f1ba00dd8de32eecb79937803ee579", "ja": "声？　こんな時間だし、俺達以外に、\n劇場に残ってる人なんていないと思うけど……。", "zh": "声音？都已经这个时间了，\n除了我们之外，应该不会有人还留在剧场里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e71d7201ecdf579c8a64e07e246cbbbf04fa95df9d2a0a4d69794173df46f687", "ja": "莉緒、俺をからかってるのか？", "zh": "莉绪，你在捉弄我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "1edbd830e4cb19c2fa44bd72ab1b195600efc80f83fb08965b3ead9071b816bc", "ja": "そんなんじゃないわよ！\nほら、耳をすませてみて……。", "zh": "才不是呢！\n你再仔细听听看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "a89bdf50b8cc7638ab83a87d7949fe987f362877dc261ad3ca4d01be0ed2b16e", "ja": "……様……が、…………らだ……。", "zh": "……们……是…………血鬼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "89c0eaee7c25643104aa448ea1a30a0c04b5a0ff3467cf355ff1800749e92da4", "ja": "！？　本当だ、声が聞こえる……！", "zh": "咦！？真的耶，有什么声音……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "cfd6fb2a35fc544f40cbe1d2d06161ef0d3e8f641134f5e0c673dd9fd5e870d3", "ja": "そういえば、劇場でウワサを聞いたことがあるわ。\n夜になると声が聞こえてくるんですって……。", "zh": "话说呀，我听过剧场有一个传闻。\n听说是到了晚上，剧场会传出声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "8b09614bba263f0351145e86b8cc34f6bdc74199ce509b77e5e76d4018f9e27f", "ja": "もしかして、この声がそのお化け？\nそれとも、本物のヴァンパイアがここに……？", "zh": "难道这个声音就是那个幽灵发出来的？\n还是说这里有真正的吸血鬼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ccf4fb397e944d716d6a094499d70214adb99e8348f5c23565bde317a68464e2", "ja": "いやいや、そんなはずは……。\nとにかく、声の正体を調べてみないと。", "zh": "不会啦，怎么可能有那种事……\n总之，我得去查清楚声音的来源。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "8237f755e7f31a73ca583794407ba99121bc4010280f1961f524539838f30497", "ja": "えっ、調べに行くの！？", "zh": "咦，你要去查来源吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "453cf4bc97e5488eda65a3c26fb8ce5249d6b00f224d3e70ee78acc9d36d7073", "ja": "聞いてしまった以上、放っておくわけにも\nいかないよ。ちょっと行ってくる。", "zh": "既然被我听到了，就不能丢着不管。\n我去去就回。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "51a48413813f2d72e10a67f0dc58135590c00ee0f6b914c4aa6efeca9730e2bb", "ja": "ち、ちょっと、{$P$}くん！\n私を置いてかないでよ～！", "zh": "等、等一下，{$P$}！\n不要丢下我啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "79e3f6d6c5e9551532858482e4b17cb6d8c97c55c8fb4c1916c9c8bd026da6ee", "ja": "声は……レッスン室から聞こえてくるみたいだな。\n……ん？　あれは……。", "zh": "声音好像……是从练习室传出来的。\n……嗯？那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "d746c9cc0ab476b4d131a7cd7156176cdfd38cf78c211c64553a1b9f9a3f9547", "ja": "……貴様らが、ヴァンパイアだからだ。", "zh": "……因为你们是吸血鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "0218d0fa865c5dd31952b5c7bc126a3d0e2121fb13b367012cc3b994db1fb022", "ja": "ふぅ……なかなか上手くいきませんわね。\nもう一度……。", "zh": "呼……一直没办法演得很好。\n再来一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "b6e9d9dc6f13d37ea916b6f1c5a397f88de12e0a78bc083a617a221f16742bcf", "ja": "な～んだ！　声の正体は、千鶴ちゃんだったのね。", "zh": "什么嘛～！结果声音的来源是千鹤啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "056a3c6270aa94254b25be8f39f657d98884b5c310021b2d1e5ed1e4296e80e2", "ja": "あら、莉緒さん……\nそれに、{$P$}も？", "zh": "咦，莉绪姊……\n还有{$P$}也来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e185b9f98ff05bd93842d04a54b575f7ce4059f4e01f291fecf040ecfb4f2772", "ja": "千鶴さんだったんですね。\nもう遅い時間だから、誰かと思いましたよ。", "zh": "原来是千鹤啊。\n因为时间已经很晚了，我还以为会是谁呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "7226dc84aa024dc40ebf564f6115558bb481a262e011827b42e63a26f5ff37c9", "ja": "まぁ……わたくしったら、扉を閉め忘れていたのね。\n声が漏れてしまったようですわ。", "zh": "哎呀……本小姐真是的，居然忘记把门关上。\n看来是声音传出去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "01a155f0bc9773cdc69c73100d2f40ffeda071f11b0a2b5328673e5a095715d8", "ja": "もしかして、自主練してたんですか？\n通し稽古は順調だったのに、どうして……。", "zh": "难道你是在自主练习吗？\n排戏不是很顺利吗？为什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "dec7f7f05f3d02eb2fac624b2b698f29a9198996c1ad890770faa1c1f7d90354", "ja": "それは……わたくしが、今回の主演だからですわ。\n大役である以上、絶対に失敗はできませんもの……。", "zh": "因为……本小姐是这次的主角。\n既然是重要角色，就绝对不能失败……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "4a24670cb372ce53146754700bca05eadcae3c834580416c95df88eae6bbdb7b", "ja": "だからこうして、自主レッスンをしていたのです。\nでも、驚かせてしまって……申し訳ありません。", "zh": "所以才会在这里自主练习。\n不过竟然还惊动你们……真的很抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "d9f4e23fe2e78737e41c7c00f768e5e2bb6b0bd8d0ffc35b0118ed083b0b28dc", "ja": "気持ちはわかりますけど、ムリは良くないですよ。\n今日は、ここまでにしておきましょう。", "zh": "我能了解你的心情，但是太过勉强也不好喔。\n今天就先练到这边吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "e3503a2463bc428f9b7ad4323d0f2cdff2aacbb4416d57bf95e9577f299646b6", "ja": "いいえ、わたくし、まだ納得できていませんの。\n{$P$}、続けさせてくださいまし！", "zh": "不行，本小姐还不满意自己的表现。\n{$P$}，请让本小姐继续练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "6455ea6d85758ea0c804401eede99d60934f0f3ec9605476c29447498469be10", "ja": "……ねぇ、{$P$}くん？\n私も、残って練習したい気分になっちゃったわ。", "zh": "……欸，{$P$}。\n我也突然有点想留下来练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "615a66c91b049e0c91c232e6435613f3d0f60e9eaa5f333e52d23f565ce05401", "ja": "ちょっとだけなら、いいでしょ？　ね？", "zh": "只练一下下的话，应该没关系吧？好嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "41e1ada130d46f1bcedd870b17d200f786d23644ef565b81d43a5e0dd1ab323a", "ja": "莉緒まで……仕方ないな。\nじゃあ、あとちょっとだけってことで。", "zh": "居然连莉绪都……真拿你们没办法。\n那只能再练一下下喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "f311a9af0a2d7896b836100fa41b57a9e149d4dddc8345e157ebfde5c7ae0015", "ja": "ウフフ、ありがと！\nあ、練習の前にエステの予約、キャンセルしないと。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢！\n啊，开始练习之前，得先取消护肤的预约才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1036_038chz", "source_sha256": "060f01765254a55d836361b524d86a64182fd0ce59b80599f13b97ea0e00290d", "ja": "え、エステのキャンセル！？\nいけませんわ、キャンセル料がかかるのでは……！", "zh": "咦，取消护肤！？\n这可不行，这样会被收取消费用……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "2f58be02f7ca92c9ca2c4b7866e79376953e12bf5e012cb2e43ce3907310b9cf", "ja": "大丈夫よ、そんなのないから！　それに私だって、\n今回の公演、良いものにしたいって思ってるもの♪", "zh": "不用担心，不会被收取消费用啦！\n而且我也想让这次的公演尽善尽美♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1038_046rio", "source_sha256": "3ec633b1489cb92eccce56f3cd5436fa8c127eef9625e93f0fc5637fb1b43973", "ja": "アダルト組として、一緒に頑張りましょう！\nねっ、千鶴ちゃん♪", "zh": "同为成年组，一起加油吧！\n好吗，千鹤♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1039_038chz", "source_sha256": "c6c9a5e2397dd8378d972f8b9eaf767c05601893cf7ad50c0c5272c4b9005f90", "ja": "莉緒さん……ええ、そうですわね。\n一緒に、良いものにしましょう！　ふふっ。", "zh": "莉绪姊……嗯，说得也是。\n一起让公演尽善尽美吧！呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "84fffd16af20efede72cdd0a70341a6052c236b5976f8bd66b057739dfead668", "ja": "（莉緒と千鶴さんは、第三幕の練習中だ。だが……）", "zh": "（莉绪和千鹤正在练习第三幕，但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1041_038chz", "source_sha256": "8cbed56c121fc7026204ee3ec113b68adf7b62b24525e293aba91aff602c7e0b", "ja": "はぁ……どうしたら良いのかしら。\n役のイメージが、上手くつかめませんわ……。", "zh": "唉……该怎么办才好呢？\n没办法精准掌握角色的形象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "73ea17e031518dd56d40b5e883d3d2dca885fd95a90283fae6e91aba46a44614", "ja": "役のイメージ、ですか？", "zh": "角色的形象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1043_038chz", "source_sha256": "0b04c483ce4d595e3bbf1ccae30e1cc7a6260c24cf49d87e9fcd86f8646cdb5d", "ja": "ええ。わたくしとこのアレクサンドラでは、\n生まれも育ちもかけ離れていて……。", "zh": "嗯，因为本小姐比起亚历山大，\n生长背景和家庭环境都相去甚远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "6934d2da50511d4098589d9fc1fd6fc461918ec83e44e2e4556e6cb5ce956ab7", "ja": "そうですか……。すみません、千鶴さん。", "zh": "这样吗……真抱歉，千鹤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "45e2b2e8416132670f0448ab4e2a39c7feaa8b537282ea95e091218892c9009e", "ja": "あら、どうして{$P$}が謝りますの？", "zh": "咦，为什么{$P$}要道歉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "609e1af0b002342c9f795242000badfff5e91f0d7cef447082d3aa2ce9ec8123", "ja": "いえ、高貴ってことで、セレブと貴族は似ていると\n思っていたものですから。俺が浅はかでした……。", "zh": "因为高贵这一点，我以为名流跟贵族很像。\n看来是我想得太粗浅了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1047_038chz", "source_sha256": "1cf3d97630134e7d6010a242fc5b240c7ad6e727b8e899dec456c106de464652", "ja": "そ、それは、似て非なるものですから、\n仕方ありませんわ！", "zh": "这、这两者本来就似是而非，\n这也是没有办法的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1048_038chz", "source_sha256": "ad78b01f7e63aa745da43330038fae3d6c976c56a4f2c22d88159bdb999575b9", "ja": "コホン。それはともかく……。\nどうすれば、貴族らしく演じられるのか……。", "zh": "咳，先不说这个……\n应该要怎么样才能演得像贵族呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1049_046rio", "source_sha256": "5881aa078400e3484ac7f35b75df7d9a967b45cd79e543a1c1b92c54787edde3", "ja": "貴族らしく、ねぇ……。でも、あんまり\n思いつめる必要はないんじゃないの？　千鶴ちゃん。", "zh": "演得像贵族吗……不过，\n我说千鹤，也不需要那么钻牛角尖吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1050_038chz", "source_sha256": "2ec57c90f6dd0ec48ad7fc5dbea97aeafcc2a41f41130f16c9de559d04a709a0", "ja": "莉緒さん。けど……。", "zh": "莉绪姊。但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1051_046rio", "source_sha256": "427d458ecf84addd6836e352796d5359f48c02117bf4854523629e63837140a3", "ja": "私だって、貴族のことなんてよくわからないけど、\nイメージで貴族役を演じているし。", "zh": "我也对贵族不是很了解，\n但是靠想像力还是可以演贵族……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1052_046rio", "source_sha256": "ac506985775d10c26adbf7cf1244413972724a5feff44c5e7da33c6d8e64f9e8", "ja": "それに大切なのは、貴族らしく演じること……\nじゃなくて、アレクサンドラらしいこと、でしょ？", "zh": "而且重要的不是演得像贵族……\n而是演得像亚历山大吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1053_038chz", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1054_046rio", "source_sha256": "716376bb68f72d3818484b80eca36892c901d1f452c74cfebdefbfa4679d1867", "ja": "それに、このアレクサンドラって、なんだかすごく\nいい人そうじゃない？　優しくて、妹思いで……。", "zh": "而且你不觉得亚历山大感觉上是个非常善良的人吗？\n既温柔，又很会替妹妹着想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1055_046rio", "source_sha256": "8e071c46f7ca12e4aa976c9b1fcd01e457f4bb79d5e057f9078b504ef8821d1c", "ja": "違う時代の人で、貴族であっても……私達と、\nそんなに考え方は違わないんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "就算是不同时代的人，又是贵族……\n跟我们的想法也相去不远吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1057_038chz", "source_sha256": "2e7c06f98990351679d845d93d883b11fc76cb6805b111a2c3f484d81f9c8c28", "ja": "ありがとうございます、莉緒さん。\nわたくし、目が覚めた気分ですわ……！", "zh": "谢谢你，莉绪姊。\n本小姐感觉豁然开朗了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1058_038chz", "source_sha256": "c9e6cedd7bc89786f53b0b1b13613b8eaec00d2a6f955d6fa6d1aa76ab32174e", "ja": "……この役は、わたくしにとって、\nとても大切な役なのです。", "zh": "……这个角色对本小姐来说，\n是非常重要的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1059_038chz", "source_sha256": "63deffb03a528c3c68dec58f304839171e31256e0b341ec16544e900acfacc02", "ja": "アレクサンドラは妹に「お前はヴァンパイアになった」\nと、真実を伝えることができずにいる……。", "zh": "亚历山大没办法诚实告诉妹妹\n「你已经变成吸血鬼了」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1060_038chz", "source_sha256": "14eeecd4076237be5d8988fee89e0fd9ab04478fd351f66532e3d8d6da7e202f", "ja": "大切な人に、隠し事をしている苦しさ……。\nわたくしには、他人事とは思えないのです。", "zh": "对重要的人隐瞒真相的痛苦……\n本小姐十分感同身受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1061_038chz", "source_sha256": "1397740189a8e1552cb077404816013849ba6105d5d07461a74832d54639d2af", "ja": "アレクサンドラらしさ……\n必ず、表現してみせますわ！", "zh": "本小姐一定可以……\n诠释出亚历山大的样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1062_p", "source_sha256": "679993db241ee85c07994ec792192cd8a8142cd25cb51139e76fe29d943cc0b6", "ja": "（その後の練習では、莉緒も千鶴さんも、\n鬼気迫る演技を見せてくれた。これならきっと……）", "zh": "（之后的练习，莉绪跟千鹤都表现出逼真的演技。\n看来这下一定可以……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1063_046rio", "source_sha256": "6d1510958ac88a664ba2ef1bed275b7e48ced647ebed49b1614cff35e8c56065", "ja": "ウフフ、私達の演技はどうだった？\n{$P$}くん♪", "zh": "呵呵，我们的演技如何呢？\n{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1064_p", "source_sha256": "00e214b2ac5b429ef0f66ce9b81bcc9735290c0696c94ecb1a7c60ae0fdf4176", "ja": "ああ、すごく良かったと思う。\nお話だという事を忘れて、見入ってしまったよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得非常好。\n我看得很入戏，都要忘记这是虚构的故事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1065_038chz", "source_sha256": "2d27b2e0a942f24cfd850f9aa8c62890d4634156390f93d532eea06520a64a9f", "ja": "……って、ああっ！？　もう、こんな時間ですの！？\n終電が行ってしまっていますわ……！", "zh": "……啊！？已经这个时间了！？\n末班车要开走了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1066_p", "source_sha256": "b8532dfed6ff1af82c953b8791023e2e25d050ca8e27f9434a8614d4daf0ee5c", "ja": "えっ？　千鶴さん、今日は電車なんですか？", "zh": "咦？千鹤今天要搭电车回家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1067_038chz", "source_sha256": "cbd74bac1a0a6bff6e878b553a6a134eacabd7c43522530c0fb17ded05ac0268", "ja": "い、いえ！　わたくしは大丈夫ですけれど、その……\n莉緒さんや{$P$}は、電車でしょう？", "zh": "不，不是的！本小姐是没什么关系，只是……\n莉绪姊跟{$P$}要搭电车吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1068_p", "source_sha256": "d815a3efb0e7ae7240cd15d26991b76b5773a3e095940bde327c7253387772e9", "ja": "ああ、なるほど。でも、大丈夫ですよ！\n今日は俺が車で送りますから。", "zh": "哦哦，原来如此。但是不用担心！\n今天我会开车送她回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1069_046rio", "source_sha256": "abc5019c046eb521f63d61cb5b00e5d189dfb6cabbf0c1050fe400f837fdf5ac", "ja": "やった♪　ありがと、{$P$}くん！\nねぇ、千鶴ちゃんも一緒に送ってもらいましょうよ。", "zh": "太好了♪谢谢你，{$P$}！\n对了，千鹤也一起搭便车嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1070_038chz", "source_sha256": "9bd994bf54b0c265c9e754f4d3f61057ed2ef27dedafdc624dfcdac4cc5eb3ff", "ja": "えっ！？　わ、わたくしは……。", "zh": "咦！？本、本小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1071_p", "source_sha256": "60c8da20631c4ca60db97ac79d82af01c6f8420c9684d5bdbb8972e9ca615758", "ja": "千鶴さん、よかったら送らせてください。\n高級車じゃなくて、申し訳ないですけど……。", "zh": "千鹤，不嫌弃的话就让我送你回家吧。\n虽然不是高级车，对你不太好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1072_038chz", "source_sha256": "65991b98ecb5dbe91db5680616b20801eed5191b07191026f702086782391711", "ja": "そ、そんな事気にしませんわ。\nありがとうございます。では、お言葉に甘えて……。", "zh": "本、本小姐不会介意那种事情。\n非常谢谢你。那本小姐就恭敬不如从命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1073_038chz", "source_sha256": "44763bb8cc54635079a501ecf75e2733e0aa0bf11814016b0fadbb33df148778", "ja": "あ、わたくしは家の近くで降ろしてくださいまし。\nええ、近くまでで結構ですわ。近くまで、で！", "zh": "啊，请让本小姐在自家附近下车就可以了。\n嗯，到附近就可以了，到附近就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_05_1074_p", "source_sha256": "f3f893ae0c55ae2f1a4cac2c0c0a6b939467e340f3fe8ffa55760d50632d1797", "ja": "（その後、ふたりを車で送り届けた。深夜までかかって\nしまったが……有意義なレッスンになって、何よりだ）", "zh": "（之后我开车送她们两人回家。虽然送完都深夜了……\n但是练习成果丰硕，比什么都值得。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
